t it does not address the functioning or performance of healthcare professionals as a cause or consequence of cognitive disorders. It contains no evidence about causal links (or lack thereof) between healthcare professional functioning and patient cognitive disorder, so it cannot support the stated \\"no causal relationship\\" claim."}], "aggregate_score": 0.3, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Functioning of healthcare professionals does not cause cognitive disorder, nor does cognitive disorder cause functioning of healthcare professionals. There is no direct causal mechanism linking these variables within the defined context. Any association between them would be explained by mediating factors such as quality of care or patient health status rather than direct causation.', 'aggregate_score': 0.3, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.461407904906689, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8012355406737981, 'min_prob': 0.01550434399672656, 'token_prob_slope': -0.005877502088789627, 'prob_variance': 0.07925662542529188, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.9356972025761352, 'avg_nll': 0.37940028949316146}

