y result from the functioning of healthcare professionals. Any connection between these variables is likely mediated by other factors such as organizational structure, personnel, or capacity. Without a clear direct causal mechanism, no causal relationship exists in either direction.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.3432323589195618, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8097172492806224, 'min_prob': 0.11119742124334292, 'token_prob_slope': -0.00499738398748156, 'prob_variance': 0.06554555065805287, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.9161879770476185, 'avg_nll': 0.2950789174078989}

