y. There is no direct causal mechanism linking these variables in either direction. Changes in one do not directly result in changes in the other.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.123748251548856, 'mean_token_prob': 0.9233289591790923, 'min_prob': 0.08399313046413495, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0033733060857570633, 'prob_variance': 0.026918273444419546, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.6435450166162324, 'avg_nll': 0.11666975089490172}

