d temporal scales means no causal pathway is established. Therefore, no causal relationship exists between frailty and feelings of fear and shame in this case.', 'aggregate_score': 0.5, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.4305002090842065, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8190102889180613, 'min_prob': 0.011009896554606222, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0029091261263302, 'prob_variance': 0.07966574908365007, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0906134535754144, 'avg_nll': 0.3580241796696435}

