thcare avoidance to change within the given definitions and context. Any apparent association would likely be mediated by other variables such as financial barriers or access to care, which are already included in the CLD. Therefore, there is no direct causal relationship between these two variables.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.2946210031046719, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8510040056317679, 'min_prob': 0.06126963362106163, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0006819327729867749, 'prob_variance': 0.06274016588987148, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.1255368835436903, 'avg_nll': 0.25821799062247563}

