ich therapy compliance directly influences knowledge. Without a direct pathway and considering possible mediators like health literacy or education level, no direct causal relationship exists between these variables.', 'aggregate_score': 0.125, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.572503345292135, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7637665113678908, 'min_prob': 0.05412007123415492, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003875785242892545, 'prob_variance': 0.09646165033910588, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.1355522078166804, 'avg_nll': 0.45266883696198273}

