urable values. Without clear definitions, no direct causal relationship can be established between these variables. Therefore, there is no causal link from mental disorder to care avoidance behavior or vice versa.", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.4307846988392952, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7821404236846266, 'min_prob': 0.07712128069165013, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0014446784782044424, 'prob_variance': 0.08342971456544777, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0840026704876549, 'avg_nll': 0.3582230342158919}

