ore": 0.4, "aggregate_verdict": "Partially supported"}', 'motivation': 'Mental disorder does not cause financial barriers, nor do financial barriers cause mental disorder in a direct causal relationship. While associations may exist, there is no direct causal mechanism linking these two variables without mediation by other factors. Therefore, no direct causal relationship should be included in the CLD.', 'aggregate_score': 0.4, 'judge_verdict': 'Partially supported', 'perplexity': 1.27087224080428, 'mean_token_prob': 0.843372329234835, 'min_prob': 0.14582511627589811, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003123534834428777, 'prob_variance': 0.05629367270386876, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0182972331616673, 'avg_nll': 0.23970346851161217}

